nflammation from arachidonic acid found in meat ) . the usda ’ s mission is to promote agribusiness , and as such public recommendations to limit animal products are often communicated in code . nutrition labels also tend to short-change plant foods . - meat , fruit , vegetarians , plant-based diets , vegetables , eggs , vegans , dairy , animal protein , fish , chicken , cancer , beans , fat , heart disease - -
