nd rehabilitate cancer cells in preclinical studies . also make sure to get an hour of exercise every day , sleep 7-hours every night , and reduce one ’ s exposure if possible to tanning beds , cell-phone radiation , ct scans , and dental x-rays.dr. greger covers cancer in his full-length presentations : - cancer , women 's health , breast cancer , cardiovascular disease , cardiovascular health , vegetables , fruit , heart disease , heart health , industry influence , mortality , side effects , oxidative stress , plant-based diets , seeds - -
